{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/312649-what-do-you-do-for-money","id":312649,"title":"What Do You Do For Money?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-14T17:42:50-08:00","id":312649,"title":"What Do You Do For Money?","content":"Jobs and employment and such. What do you do so you can afford OPP games and the like? I'm curious because this forum is full of pretty hardcore fans, and I take an anthropological interest in such things.<br /> <br /> What's the job you're currently in, or what are you currently studying (or thinking about studying)?<br /> <br /> Where would you like your career to go?<br /> <br /> What's your dream job?<br /> <hr /><br /> I work in the entertainment industry in Los Angeles myself, and have for the past several years to varying degrees of success. We'll see how long I stick it out, as there's a lot of reality-style programming jobs right now and I'm not particularly interested in that.<br /> <br /> I'd moved out here to do screenwriting, but haven't done a whole lotta that. I'm thinking about what I'd like to do now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-14T18:06:47-08:00","id":312679,"title":"","content":"I work for a non-profit publisher that deals in Canadian human rights law. I basically do data entry, copyediting, and write summaries of boring court procedure and (occasionally) little human dramas. I also write plays and put them on with my partner and our theatre company, but we don't really make money off that.<br /> <br /> Oh, and, uh, I guess Onyx Path, too! But I've only done one thing so far...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-14T18:19:17-08:00","id":312693,"title":"","content":"Your Carthian icon is certainly apropos, then! And congrats on freelancing.<br /> <br /> Playwriting is a particularly thankless trade, I've been told, so it's good you have a passion for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-14T18:55:23-08:00","id":312698,"title":"","content":"Oh yeah, Carthians are my spirit Covenant, if one can have such a thing. They're not so much on the &quot;human&quot; rights as I am, but you see what I'm getting at.<br /> <br /> Theatre is my first love as a writer; it's 90% of the reason I adore WoD (the other 10% is vampires and cool powers).<br /> <br /> And thanks! Writing for a White Wolf book is amazingly cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-14T19:18:00-08:00","id":312702,"title":"","content":"I work the Front Desk at a Hotel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">\u263e</span></span></b></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/438-wulf","name":"wulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar438_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-14T20:16:49-08:00","id":312711,"title":"","content":"I work for my dad, an Independent Contractor leased onto another company in the truck industry. He worked as a truck driver for several years, which he hated, and finally made enough money to hire other drivers to work drive for him so he would never have to drive a truck again. I do clerical work, mainly handling the payroll, and basically do whatever odd job he needs me to do. It doesn't pay much, but I do get free room and board, and I don't really have to worry about my boss firing me.<br /> <br /> The one thing I've learned over all these years? EVERYONE is trying to cheat you. EVERYONE. <i>Especially</i> the government.<br /> <br /> I wish I was joking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 11-14-2014, 11:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-14T21:22:41-08:00","id":312751,"title":"","content":"I work tech support. I have done that for several years now for varying companies. Currently, it is for a home security system.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-14T22:16:51-08:00","id":312777,"title":"","content":"Dream job: Something that lets me be creative, that doesn't have me answering phones or talking to customers and what lets me sit down, drink coffee and crack wise with other strange, creative people who are or are borderline amoral.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">\u263e</span></span></b></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/438-wulf","name":"wulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar438_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-14T22:18:50-08:00","id":312778,"title":"","content":"I beg for money from the government as a poor student.<br /> <br /> I beg for a job from Onyx path as a nutjob.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T05:39:01-08:00","id":312881,"title":"","content":"I work for a software development support company as a QA Tester and UX Engineer.<br /> <br /> I realized this past year that I should have studied mechanical engineering instead of mathematics and designed toys for Hasbro.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T06:57:51-08:00","id":312900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Metamurpho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/312649-what-do-you-do-for-money#post312649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's the job you're currently in?</div> </div> </div> </div>I work in hospice care.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Metamurpho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/312649-what-do-you-do-for-money#post312649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where would you like your career to go?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have no thoughts on the issue.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Metamurpho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/312649-what-do-you-do-for-money#post312649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's your dream job?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have no thoughts on the issue.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T07:55:26-08:00","id":312959,"title":"","content":"What I do I do for money? Anything, as long as you pay the right price. Or in other words, I am a Lawyer <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I could say it's my dream job since I wanted it since a teenager, although I would be happy as a Historian, Anthropologist or Literature, but no money in there and in my country 1 in 1000 are successful in those areas.<br /> <br /> Despite loving law I'm not doing what I like at the moment. I'm working with Debt and Bankruptcy Law mostly which is boring as hell. I wish I could go back to Labour, Contracts, Enterprise, etc. but one has to go where the money is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2435,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2435-prophet","user":"Prophet","date":". 11-17-2014, 04:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2435-prophet","name":"Prophet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2435_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"329"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T08:18:01-08:00","id":312968,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Metamurpho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/312649-what-do-you-do-for-money#post312649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's the job you're currently in, or what are you currently studying (or thinking about studying)?</div> </div> </div> </div>I work in a computer parts retailer on commission to sell built PCs, components, and other high price items like televisions. However, I'm presently studying for an accounting degree so I can actually make some money in my life.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Metamurpho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/312649-what-do-you-do-for-money#post312649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where would you like your career to go?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd like to get a nice job keeping books or something like that, hopefully for a company that I don't hate. Something with a desk, benefits, retirement options, you know. Security. I've worked some shit jobs and once I had to work 4 days in a row without sleep, and man, I don't want to go back to that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Metamurpho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/312649-what-do-you-do-for-money#post312649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's your dream job?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hadn't really thought of it. If you asked me when I was a kid, I'd have told you serving in the military or flying planes. i've done the military part. I guess I'd still like to fly planes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>A Green Sun Destrier</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/77-kongurous","name":"kongurous","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar77_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"417"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T12:43:07-08:00","id":313200,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I beg for money from the government as a poor student. </div> </div> </div>Move to Denmark, they pay students enough money to live relatively stable life without working.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> I take translation commissions, mostly legal. <br /> <br /> One day when I will become a sworn translator and there is a genuine demand for Onyx products in my native language, I offer my aid.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-16T19:47:45-08:00","id":314153,"title":"","content":"I'm currently studying english here in France. Two years ago, I earned my Bachelor's Degree in translation, and went on to work on my Master. Unfortunately last year, I spent most of year in a hospital, so i took the year off school. When I came back this year in September, I learned that they had changed the entire syllabus this Summer, and made it something that I don't like : I thought that I would be able to choose which classes i wanted to take. But when last year, I had six hours of translation class a week, now it's only a lousy hour and a half. And I have to do an essay, but teachers have already refused 5 differents subjects of mine. I'm starting to get sick of it, and I don't even want to fight anymore. I went into english because that was an easy class for me in highschool. I like translating stuff, but when I think about making it my job, it bores me. I don't even know why I'm in this course anymore.<br /> <br /> I want to study something that I really love, something that I'm passionate about, get a diploma and find some work with it. Problem is, I don't know what. I like. I have two passions, RPG and mythology. The state of the rpg industry in France won't allow me to pay the bills if I get a job in there, and I'm not even a good writer. As for mythology...I really love it. I'm really curious about certain cultures in particular (Norse, Celtic, South American...), but I don't know I'll be able to get any job with that. I've never heard of a job that requires you to have a vast knowledge of myths and legends...<br /> <br /> And I can't stand the idea of getting a job that I don't enjoy. I know it's idealist, but... I know I'll crush me otherwise.<br /> <br /> Thankfully, like Denmark, I have money from the government for my studies. Unlike Denmark, it's only for students that doesn't come from a family with a comfortable situation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T02:11:02-08:00","id":314340,"title":"","content":"I'm employed at a computer consultant/contractor firm, and currently work with &quot;application repackaging&quot; for windows (I like windows, I really do; it is so stupidly handled so there is a lot of money in making things usable).<br /> <br /> Can't say I have an opinion on a dream job. As long it is decent hours, nice work mates, not to long commute (I can currently walk to work), and pays me enough to feed my RPG hoarding, I'm happy. Don't know if it should count as a dream or not, but I have found out it isn't to late to finish up my bachelor degree in machine engineering. I have until June to finish up a thesis, but it is a requirement of the institution to have an external party (firm, organization, etc) as some form of customer/employer/recipient of the paper. Finding one in time, to do something I'm enough interested in, feels a bit like a dream at the moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2839-lundgren","name":"Lundgren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T09:27:11-08:00","id":315474,"title":"","content":"I work for a company that spends all their time convincing people to gamble on themselves in exchange for a vague promise of a better life. They give us large amounts of money on the chance they will have to spend less than that should the need arise. If they do need our services, then they've admitted they are in a vulnerable place and are forced to jump thru whatever hoops we put in front of them to get what they came to us for. And when all is said and done, what you've gained from our services is something you'll never be able to keep and will always be a diminishing return on your investment.<br /> <br /> If you haven't guessed yet, I work for a medical provider and health care insurance company and I don't feel good about it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T06:48:34-08:00","id":316221,"title":"","content":"DBA and Reports Developer for a &quot;small&quot; firm in NW Houston. Not my dream job, but it pays the bills and covers the student loan it took to get the job.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/771-starmage21","name":"Starmage21","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar771_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom"