k burnt out that my brain cells go on strike when I leave work.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/312649-what-do-you-do-for-money?p=315474#post315474\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I work for a company that spends all their time convincing people to gamble on themselves in exchange for a vague promise of a better life. They give us large amounts of money on the chance they will have to spend less than that should the need arise. If they do need our services, then they've admitted they are in a vulnerable place and are forced to jump thru whatever hoops we put in front of them to get what they came to us for. And when all is said and done, what you've gained from our services is something you'll never be able to keep and will always be a diminishing return on your investment.<br /> <br /> If you haven't guessed yet, I work for a medical provider and health care insurance company and I don't feel good about it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was going to say that if I didn't know better I would have thought you worked for the government.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T14:26:32-08:00","id":316532,"title":"","content":"Software Developer, same thing I've been doing for the last 15 years. Currently working for a company out by Sacramento CA where my company makes point of sale and general inventory management software, which has me in the situation of knowing far more about credit/debit/gift cards and how they're processed than most people would ever want to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T15:03:01-08:00","id":316550,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorwen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/312649-what-do-you-do-for-money?p=316524#post316524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was going to say that if I didn't know better I would have thought you worked for the government.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is no government on Earth that has a bureaucratic maze that outstrips where I work. No place is more compartmentalized and keeps their lackeys in the dark as much as where I work.<br /> <br /> The office building I work in should be redesigned to match either the monolith from 2001 or Sauron